# Anything listed here is invisible to COPY during an image build.
#
# The build stages copy whole directories (COPY packages ./packages,
# COPY apps/api ./apps/api), so without this file a node_modules tree left on
# the host — Windows or macOS binaries — would be copied over the one the image
# installed for Linux, and the container would fail at runtime for reasons that
# point nowhere near the real cause.

# Dependencies: always installed inside the image, never carried in.
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Build output: regenerated by the image's own build stage.
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Flutter, which is not part of any image.
**/.dart_tool
**/build/app
apps/customer-app/build
apps/driver-app/build
apps/provider-app/build

# Local secrets must never be baked into an image. Compose supplies them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# History and editor state.
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
